 (text "Latch and rails: Pololu #2813, R-78E 5 V, Castle BEC, dev-kit feed, lidar, camera 12 V" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (thickness 0.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "dc085bbc-d805-5d64-9071-b7cfb7f5be2b"))
(text "Button (on board or remote) pulls the Pololu ON input high through 33k from BAT (2.0 V at 12 V, 3.9 V max)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "03f39a18-a94d-5ce5-a80b-e94d39bd11c3"))
(text "and, through Q401, pulls BUTTON_N low for the Pico. The Pico ends power with a LATCH_OFF pulse." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "abb8cc65-4653-580b-a759-d42f0c27df83"))
(text "R-78E5.0-1.0 (8-28 V in) behind 4.7 Ohm + P6KE20A, so a 30 V spike on VSYS_SW reaches it as <= 22 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 43.18000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "cf75c154-34ed-56df-95ca-1523f3317327"))
(text "Pico VSYS through a 1N5817 (Pico datasheet 4.5): the Pico USB cable cannot back-feed the 5 V rail." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 48.260000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "e03e7661-41ad-5520-857c-907a2a8733bf"))
(text "Dev kit: 5 A mini blade fuse -> P6KE22A -> over-voltage cut-off (IRF4905, TL431 trips at 18.7 V, releases 17.85 V)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "d100748a-41b8-5fa0-bb49-43a60ce82b6a"))
(text "-> 18 AWG pads; the carrier is rated 9-20 V. The cut-off guards the dev kit against regen with the BMS open;" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "630eb854-0009-5694-ab1f-e6a8daa5ed74"))
(text "the same P-FET lets the Pico power-cycle a hung Jetson (GP22 DEVKIT_PWR low = off)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "0c24255a-6e34-52ce-8d11-a22ea01760a5"))
(text "Lidar: IRF9Z34N high side, 10k/10k gate divider, 100 nF soft start, MF-R075, P6KE22A, Phoenix 2-pin." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 68.58000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "d49ee0e9-3466-5d4c-aa92-c5c6378734f8"))
(text "Camera: MF-R075 -> P6KE22A -> wire pads -> Pololu S18V20F12 (off board) -> camera lead." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 73.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "556223c5-35cc-5e66-911b-c43be276a504"))
(text "Servo: Castle BEC 2.0 from VM (J401), or from VSYS_SW (J410) if its start-up load stops the precharge (M3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 78.74000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "72c00404-b3a9-5fea-9b85-7c121a5e3084"))
